WEBVTT

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:46.860
I'm back!

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:15.740
Tonight's dinner was...

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:18.580
Deep...Fried...Shrimp...?

00:02:19.130 --> 00:02:21.250
Stop being creepy!

00:02:22.060 --> 00:02:22.890
Godai?

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:24.090
Yes?
Come in!

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:28.730
I made too much food.
Would you like some?

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:32.070
Thank you very much!

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:34.740
What are you saying, Godai?

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:39.580
Didn't you stop and eat
at Kozue's after your date?

00:02:39.780 --> 00:02:40.370
Hey!

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:43.040
So what? It's only the truth.

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:46.740
Smells delicious!

00:02:47.590 --> 00:02:49.750
If you've already eaten...

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:52.290
Mr. Yotsuya and Akemi,
please help yourselves!

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:55.690
Mana...ger!

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:57.790
Godai...

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:01.820
Isn't this great...?
Deep Fried Shrimp.

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:07.960
Maybe what you need is
to fall head over heels.

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:12.370
Why don't you devote
yourself to Kozue?

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:13.810
Butt out!

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:17.780
Poor little Kozue...

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:22.190
You're just leading her on...
and dragging her around.

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:25.220
Mmm... Delicious!

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:44.570
Seven! That's a new record!

00:03:44.650 --> 00:03:45.810
I'm gonna beat it!

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:49.810
It's toasty!

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:55.080
I love winter!

00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:57.180
'Cause you can get
roasted sweet potatoes?

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:58.650
That, too...

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:03.020
...but in the summer
I feel like I'm going to melt.

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:05.920
Winter keeps me on my toes.

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:08.430
It doesn't make much difference
when the heater's on...

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:10.000
That's true...

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:12.700
But I prefer a heater in the winter...

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:14.870
over A/C in the summer.

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:29.180
May I hold your arm?

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:34.820
Being close feels better in
the winter than in the summer.

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:41.690
Do I have potato on my face?

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:44.600
No... I just thought you looked cute.

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:50.210
Oh, stop, Godai!

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:10.260
Hello.

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:12.090
Hi.

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:17.070
Did you have a fight with Kozue?

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:18.890
Huh?

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:21.600
You look down...

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:24.540
Do I?

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:29.780
They say fighting is a sign
of affection. Right, Soichiro?

00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:32.630
Wait up, Soichiro!

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:44.650
If that's the case...

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:48.370
...you gotta make her hate you.

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:52.830
If you wanna break up with her
without hurting her feelings...

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:53.800
that's the only way.

00:05:55.980 --> 00:05:57.530
You can act like a pervert.

00:06:00.850 --> 00:06:01.900
A pervert...

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:04.750
Are you a good actor?

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:05.630
No.

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:07.720
'Cause if you make her
feel sorry for you...

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:10.350
that could have
the opposite effect.

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:18.560
So maybe it's best to
show her your real bad habits.

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:20.360
Like?

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:23.960
Maybe you should let her
see you plastered...

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:27.700
or let her see you
flirting with another girl.

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:34.840
You know...just do what you
usually do with Ms. Otonashi.

00:06:36.220 --> 00:06:37.580
Wouldn't that be easy, Godai?

00:06:43.230 --> 00:06:46.320
Godai, it's a phone call from Kozue!

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:47.420
C-Coming...

00:06:58.410 --> 00:06:59.030
Hello?

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:02.240
Tomorrow?

00:07:03.510 --> 00:07:06.960
Okay. I have something important
I want to discuss.

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:16.580
Godai's gonna talk to Kozue
about "something important."

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:18.910
Eavesdropping again?

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:23.890
I wonder what's so "important"?

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:25.560
You think he's gonna propose?

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:29.220
No way!

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:32.030
I-I mean... He's still a student...

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:35.440
Then...maybe he's breaking up with her.

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:37.400
Maybe they had a fight after all.

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:38.340
You think so?

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:42.810
He looked depressed

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:46.120
when he came back from his date
with Kozue yesterday.

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:50.950
I told him fighting
is a sign of affection.

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:52.260
That's it...

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:55.560
You're pretty dense, too...

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:11.500
Manager...

00:08:11.980 --> 00:08:13.140
Good morning!

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:17.480
My ceiling is leaking;
it's pretty bad.

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:19.780
I'll have it fixed by
the end of the day.

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:21.480
Bye...

00:08:24.590 --> 00:08:26.020
Have a nice day!

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:29.520
There goes Mr. Sunshine...

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:37.770
I can't let this meeting
get friendly.

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:43.430
After all, I have to
break up with her.

00:08:55.490 --> 00:08:57.280
Godai! I'm here!

00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:11.330
You know what, Kozue?

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:13.260
Today...

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:15.230
What?

00:09:22.180 --> 00:09:23.270
Welcome.

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:25.420
I'll have coffee.

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:26.440
Sure.

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:39.060
Do you like blue?

00:09:40.840 --> 00:09:41.700
Yeah...

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:44.160
Great!

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:46.200
I...

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:48.870
Here.

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:53.670
It's been a while
since Christmas, but...

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:56.010
Try it on!

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:01.450
You don't like it?

00:10:06.760 --> 00:10:09.320
No, I like it! Thank you!

00:10:09.970 --> 00:10:12.870
Really? I'm so glad!

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:45.190
DUMB ASS!!!

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:55.910
M-Manager!

00:10:56.480 --> 00:10:58.410
What're you doing up there?!

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:00.640
Fixing the roof...

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:05.240
Godai, did I just hear
you yell "dumb ass"?

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:08.310
No. Uh...

00:11:11.590 --> 00:11:12.680
Forget it.

00:11:12.930 --> 00:11:16.950
Wait! Did Mr. Yotsuya do
something to you again?

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:24.460
No... It's nothing, really.

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:27.840
I'm the manager here!
I need to know!

00:11:29.550 --> 00:11:33.210
Like I said... It's nothing.

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:34.310
Godai.

00:11:34.680 --> 00:11:36.580
It's not something I can
discuss with a manager.

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:38.780
It's no use, anyway.

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:42.580
If only I could talk to Kyoko...

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:44.820
Godai...

00:11:55.070 --> 00:11:55.690
Why?

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:46.650
Oh, no...

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:07.810
Manager! I'll help you!

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:14.270
It's okay. I'm just
a good-for-nothing manager.

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:16.640
What're you saying?

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:21.450
I'll be fine.
I don't impose on my residents.

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:23.880
Are you crazy?!

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:45.510
Why didn't you yell for help?!

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:48.440
But...

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:49.580
No buts!

00:13:51.090 --> 00:13:52.520
The gutter's half-rotten!

00:13:54.320 --> 00:13:55.300
G-Godai!

00:14:15.350 --> 00:14:18.580
It's been three days
since I broke my leg...

00:14:29.990 --> 00:14:31.110
Here you are!

00:14:31.190 --> 00:14:32.170
You okay?

00:14:32.560 --> 00:14:33.350
Here we are!

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:38.330
This is from the Manager.

00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:42.760
Where is she?

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:45.430
Under the moonlit sky...

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:47.560
She hugs her knees
beneath her nightgown...

00:14:48.210 --> 00:14:51.040
Feeling the pain
she caused in another...

00:14:52.150 --> 00:14:53.840
She's depressed.

00:14:55.350 --> 00:14:57.910
She says it's her fault
that you broke your leg.

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:00.250
It wasn't her fault.

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:06.590
Anyway, she took care of
admitting you to the hospital...

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:09.250
your change of clothes,
calling your parents...

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:11.330
She did everything.

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:12.160
But...

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:18.160
Godai! No one told me
you're in the hospital!

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:20.300
How did you break your leg?

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:22.910
How? Huh? How?

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:27.100
Uh... Well, Kozue...

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:51.760
Soichiro...

00:15:58.150 --> 00:15:59.130
We're back.

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:01.910
How was Godai?

00:16:02.550 --> 00:16:06.780
If you're so worried,
why don't you visit him yourself?

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:22.530
He seemed pretty down.

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:33.670
He didn't even touch
the cake we took him...

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:40.810
Manager, you really should go.

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:46.580
He's waiting for your visit.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:10.270
There she is!

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:19.080
Hey! Where're you...?

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:38.360
Wait! Why am I hiding?

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:40.410
I'll be my cheery self.

00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:51.250
I can't believe it...

00:17:55.530 --> 00:17:57.790
She came all the way here...

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:02.230
Um... I'm really very sorry.

00:18:03.610 --> 00:18:06.970
It's okay. I'm sorry, too.

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:10.810
What?! You're kidding!

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:14.510
In any case, she said
she's taking care of him...

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:17.010
until he's released
from the hospital.

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:19.440
No... No way!

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:27.620
Ms. Otonashi...

00:18:27.800 --> 00:18:28.450
Mitaka!

00:18:29.030 --> 00:18:33.760
Thank God! I thought he was
forcing you to do menial tasks

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:36.300
just because he's hospitalized.

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:38.130
Coach Mitaka...

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:43.810
Your hands shouldn't be used
for looking after him.

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:49.170
Let me take care of his laundry;
I'll be sure to incinerate them.

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:50.140
H-Hey!

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:51.580
Oh, hi.

00:18:56.590 --> 00:18:57.550
Thank you.

00:19:05.940 --> 00:19:07.030
You look well.

00:19:07.770 --> 00:19:09.430
Whaddaya want?

00:19:10.510 --> 00:19:14.130
I think you're
taking advantage of her.

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:16.730
She's the manager...

00:19:16.810 --> 00:19:20.170
but it's not her job to take
care of you in the hospital.

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:24.610
Well, there's a long story
behind this.

00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:27.080
Really? What?

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:30.690
Like you broke your leg
trying to save her life?

00:19:31.030 --> 00:19:31.680
That's right.

00:19:32.530 --> 00:19:35.290
Poor thing... She's got such
a strong sense of responsibility.

00:19:35.600 --> 00:19:39.930
Ah, but of course!
She feels responsible. I get it.

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:42.860
Well, see you!

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:46.270
I see... She feels it's her duty.

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:48.870
That's not it!

00:20:04.560 --> 00:20:05.920
You're working so hard...

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:10.750
Could this be more than just
a manager-resident relationship...?

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:15.370
No... It's not like that...

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:38.320
It's not like that... I...

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:51.700
I have to take care of him!

00:21:14.060 --> 00:21:15.990
What a great day!

00:21:18.570 --> 00:21:20.470
Thanks for spending
such nice day here.

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:21.500
No problem.

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:24.220
Would you like to go outside?

00:21:25.610 --> 00:21:26.090
Yes.

00:21:33.150 --> 00:21:34.310
Are you cold?

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:37.210
No. It's quiet today, isn't it?

00:21:37.390 --> 00:21:38.010
Yes...

00:21:42.560 --> 00:21:45.180
Is Maison Ikkoku
all right without you?

00:21:46.100 --> 00:21:49.960
Don't you worry
about that, Godai. Besides...

00:21:50.400 --> 00:21:50.990
Besides?

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:54.700
Besides...

00:21:58.110 --> 00:21:58.660
Huh?

00:22:03.680 --> 00:22:04.200
Hm...?

00:22:07.820 --> 00:22:08.910
How beautiful!

00:22:17.490 --> 00:22:18.470
Watch out!

00:23:03.440 --> 00:23:04.930
Sh-Shall we go back?

00:23:05.180 --> 00:23:06.510
I-I guess we should.

00:23:19.360 --> 00:23:23.290
I broke my leg skiing!
How embarrassing!

00:23:25.500 --> 00:23:28.430
And you were brought all the way
to this hospital?

00:23:28.500 --> 00:23:30.330
And you requested this room?

00:23:30.570 --> 00:23:34.090
Don't worry.
I'll visit you every day.

00:23:34.670 --> 00:23:37.000
Good-lookin' men do this, too, huh?

00:23:41.310 --> 00:23:45.640
GODAI YUSAKU
MITAKA SHUN

00:23:49.890 --> 00:23:52.120
You really don't trust me, do you?

00:23:52.460 --> 00:23:56.260
It's true I came here because
I knew you'd be here, but...

00:23:57.000 --> 00:24:01.090
Next: "Sparking Fireworks of Love!
Godai and Mitaka's Reluctant Recuperation"

00:24:01.670 --> 00:24:04.930
It's time we face off
once and for all, Godai.
